You need to modify the "Schedule" service to use an account that has
access to the network resources that you wish to backup.  You will
need to create a batch file to use the NET USE commands to perform
the mapping/unmapping.  This approach has a major problem: if there is
any error (or the tape fills) this will freeze the backup and force
you to manually kill the task.

A much better solution is to purchase a 3rd party backup solution, such
as UltraBac that is properly designed as an enterprise-wide backup product.

