I currently have this functionality under 3.51 (sp4) workstation.  I've   
setup directories for all local userids under my root ftp directory.   
 When any of these users ftp to my workstation, they automatically   
(magic) are placed in their corresponding directory.  I've got anonymous   
access turned off.  Also, as pointed out by Aaron, you may want your ftp   
directories on an NTFS volume so you can restrict the access of your   
users.

Tim Bailer
JHU/APL
