Tony,

I think you'll find that NT 3.5 requires at least Service Pack 2 to see 
files compressed on an NT 3.51 server.  you shouldn't have any problems 
with your other platforms.

At this stage compression is performed by the host machine, although 
there was some talk a while back about possibly transmitting the file 
in a compressed form and letting the client do the decompressing in a 
future release of NT.

Phil.

