Have you tried setting the print driver to pass the raw data?  That's a   
setting in the "Printer Properties, Details..." setting.  If the datatype   
is set to TEXT, it will just dump the .ps contents; raw will send the PS   
code to be interpreted.

Maybe, maybe not.  But worth a try.

