Subject: Installing a Matrox Millenium Card

I am trying to install a Matrox Millenuim Card into an AlphaServer 1000 4/233.
What I did was change the driver through the Display Contol Panel applet,
shutdown and turned off the system, inserted the Card into the PCI Slot,
moved the J27 jumper on the systemboard to the off position to disable the
SVGA as described in the AlphaServer Owners Manual.

After doing this the system wouldnt start. It was as if the power plug was
disconnected from the box. I then opened up the computer and changed the j27
jumper back to the on position and it is working fine again using the
onboard SVGA.

