Subject: FTP DATA CONFIDENTIALITY / ACCESS ON THE FLY

Another way to provide a easy/quick/secure FTP area is to partition your
hard drive and assign the new partition (E: ?) R or RW access via the WINNT
FTP Control Panel, and to disallow access to your other drives (C:, D:,
etc).  This will prevent anyone coming in using the FTP protocol to even see
your other drives.

