Two further points:
A. Double check your video display driver. Esp. if itegegrated 
Cirrus or Powerstorm as standard VGA is *not* supported. If NT 
cd is provided by Digital then driver is in 
drvlib\video\cirrus...Driver not necessarily provided if cd by
Microsoft. If VGA not supported, driver must be specified during 
NT installation or installation will not complete.

B. If you ever want to convert your disk partition to NTFS, 
consider creating a fat partition of at least several meg for 
osloader etc....

